"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qEoF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9eb11c7-31c6-41d7-9366-e90dee7f25aa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"何が最近の話題なのか、とかは面白いですね","ts":"1632182363.279300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QGWbi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bce106a-98ed-438d-8366-89083fa9806b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"レビューのイントロとかならまあざっと眺めて面白いなとは思う","ts":"1632182261.278700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QpoU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"649d3be3-1d9a-4ca9-b08f-fe2af77832e0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"論文は見つけたところで読めないので（中身の解釈的な意味で）、現実的には本を探すしかないと思いますがね","ts":"1632182198.278000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46e620c6-b9e3-47af-8944-52ec5936be15","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"読む論文のチョイスはまあcitation impactとかの値を雑に見て","ts":"1632182133.276600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C2Hbq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4de7c951-9cda-4371-80d8-dc5a8db1df3a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"結局のところブログは書籍とかを元にしてて書籍は論文を元にしてたりするので、いきなり論文だと伝言ゲームによる曲解を防げるかなー的な","ts":"1632182098.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2355ae8b-b514-442e-a5cb-7147b23520c0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"このへんかな","ts":"1632182062.275400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"alo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"658eba1e-4414-4099-b305-6bf91531f13a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4371544/\u003e","ts":"1632182059.275100","att